1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:08,000
HomeBrain brings your local forecast and live environmental sensors together in one place.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:19,000
On the Dashboard, the Climate card shows current weather, indoor air quality,
wind, rainfall, pressure, and today’s outlook.

3
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Select Weather in the side menu to open the Weather Command Deck.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:39,000
The deck combines your saved-location forecast with live Tempest station
readings and indoor air data.

5
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Use the summary cards for the daily outlook, indoor temperature,
wind, pressure, and rainfall.

6
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Select Refresh whenever you want the latest connected readings.

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,000
That is the HomeBrain weather system.
